    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Ceuswark, set in a fantasy world, attracts the attention of evil forces. When the villagers learn that these forces plan to raid their humble village, which has roots going back thousands of years, they quickly reach out to a wizard named Osdam. They tell him they are ready to give all their wealth to protect their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Osdam does not know what ruthless forces he will face. However, he quickly realizes that these enemies are unlike the demonic forces he has fought before. Despite this, he declares that he will do his best and rushes to help the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy all evil enemies and giant monsters attacking the village of Ceuswark Defenders and save the village.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variety</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities and traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich atmosphere with high-quality sound design.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive gameplay</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Ceuswark, set in a fantasy world, attracts the attention of evil forces. When the villagers learn that these forces plan to raid their humble village, which has roots going back thousands of years, they quickly reach out to a wizard named Osdam. They tell him they are ready to give all their wealth to protect their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Osdam does not know what ruthless forces he will face. However, he quickly realizes that these enemies are unlike the demonic forces he has fought before. Despite this, he declares that he will do his best and rushes to help the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy all evil enemies and giant monsters attacking the village of Ceuswark Defenders and save the village.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variety</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities and traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich atmosphere with high-quality sound design.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive gameplay</p></li></ul>",
